  "changed_since_previous": "No changes to the patch content or approach since the previous description.",
  "card": "Speeds up functional test execution by converting `p2p_lock` to a `threading.Condition` that immediately wakes `wait_until_helper_internal` upon P2P message delivery or connection changes instead of polling every 50ms, and sets `noban_tx_relay = True` across three wallet tests. This eliminates avoidable idle time in CI and local test execution. The author reports an 11% decrease in wall time (-j=18) and a 17.5% reduction in accumulated test runtime, with several individual test times dropping by 80% or more.",
